ual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m009-0152","start":152,"end":154,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m009-0161","start":161,"end":163,"surface":"亞父","kind":"person","person_id":"uw6_a0a_tjp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m009-0164","start":164,"end":166,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m009-0206","start":206,"end":208,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m009-0211","start":211,"end":216,"surface":"女子二千人","kind":"unresolved","person_id":null,"status":"unresolved","note":"未名者、群體、泛稱官職、氏族或代詞待覆核，不補姓名或未見家屬。"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m009-0227","start":227,"end":229,"surface":"陳平","kind":"person","person_id":"i3f_9l9_g53","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-056-chen:m009-0231","start":231,"end":233,"surface":"漢王","kind":"person","person_id":"yqp_nlb_p1p_A","status":"contextual_provisional"}],"chapter_id":"c-shiji-056-chen","book_id":"b-shiji-056","work_id":"w-shiji","source_id":"s-shiji-056-chen"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:p023","text":"項王亡將鐘離眛家在伊廬，素與信善。項王死後，亡歸信。漢王怨眛，聞其在楚，詔楚捕眛。信初之國，行縣邑，陳兵出入。漢六年，人有上書告楚王信反。髙帝以陳平計，天子巡狩會諸侯，南方有雲夢，發使告諸侯會陳：『吾將游雲夢。』實欲襲信，信弗知。髙祖且至楚，信欲發兵反，自度無罪，欲謁上，恐見禽。人或說信曰：『斬眛謁上，上必喜，無患。』信見眛計事。眛曰：『漢所以不擊取楚，以眛在公所。若欲捕我以自媚於漢，吾今日死，公亦隨手亡矣。』乃罵信曰：『公非長者！』卒自剄。信持其首，謁髙祖於陳。上令武士縛信，載後車。信曰：『果若人言，「狡兔死，良狗亨；髙鳥盡，良弓藏；敵國破，謀臣亡。」天下已定，我固當亨！』上曰：『人告公反。』遂械系信。至雒陽，赦信罪，以爲淮陰侯。","annotation_status":"named_mentions_first_pass","text_layer":"received_chapter","mentions":[{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m023-0000","start":0,"end":2,"surface":"項王","kind":"person","person_id":"ob7_g6i_7pp","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m023-0004","start":4,"end":7,"surface":"鐘離眛","kind":"person","person_id":"tb2_zhz_mol","status":"contextual_provisional"},{"id":"c-shiji-092-hanxin:m023-0014","start":14,"end